# Complex polynomials in engineering

**Authors:** Khier Benmahammed, Saeed Badran, Bassam Kourdi

## Summary
Techniques for the evaluation of complex polynomials with one and two variables are introduced. Polynomials arise in may areas such as control systems, image and signal processing, coding theory, electrical networks, etc., and their evaluations are time consuming. This paper introduces new evaluation algorithms that are straightforward with fewer arithmetic operations.


